me/protein and referring to the disorder itself, and the THEN clause to specify tagging the full nominal span including that complement.\n\nI'm also sketching exclusion cases: attributive adjectives modifying a phenotype should go to Modifier, mechanistic consequence phrases without a named disorder should be O, gene names modifying an existing explicit disease head should stay outside the disease span, and symptom/sign mentions fall under separate rules. I'm checking this against the BRCA1-type pattern to make sure the gene stays excluded there, while confirming that for a deficiency-of-enzyme construction the enzyme name should be included within the span.\n\n", "type": "thinking"}, {"text": "- **Principle: Nominal Deficiency-State Heads That Name a Disorder**\n  - **IF** a noun phrase has a state noun as its head (a nominal deficiency or deficient-activity term, not an adjective), and that head takes a prepositional or genitive complement naming a gene, enzyme, or protein, **AND** the phrase refers to the disorder itself, either as a condition a patient has or as the condition a syndrome or disease is defined or caused by (including passive \"caused by a [state noun] of X\" frames),\n  - **THEN** tag the full nominal span, including the enzyme or gene complement, as SpecificDisease, because the state noun functions as a disease head rather than a biochemical description.\n  - **Does NOT apply** when:\n    - (a) the deficiency term is an attributive adjective modifying a phenotype, entity, or patient type (e.g., \"[gene]-deficient phenotype\"). Tag as Modifier.\n    - (b) the phrase describes a molecular or mechanistic consequence of a mutation, such as a verb frame like \"results in a [state noun] of X,\" and no disorder is named. Tag as O.\n    - (c) a gene or enzyme name modifies an explicit disease head noun. Keep the gene outside the disease span, as in the existing True Positives.\n    - (d) the mention is a symptom or sign (e.g., fever, arthritis). These fall under symptom-level guidance, not this rule.", "type": "text"}], "diagnostics": null, "model": "claude-haiku-5-5", "role": "assistant", "stop_details": null, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "stop_sequence": null, "type": "message", "usage": {"cache_creation": {"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0}, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0, "cache_read_input_tokens": 0, "inference_geo": "global", "input_tokens": 2272, "output_tokens": 2343, "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 1866}, "service_tier": "batch", "speed": "standard"}}}